effect addCommonHeaders write http.response
memory addCommonHeaders arena request
async addCommonHeaders no
useCapability addCommonHeaders httpResponseWriter
purpose operation addCommonHeaders "Attach stable API headers before a response body is written."
invariant operation addCommonHeaders "Headers are static and written before any response body writer runs."
label startAddCommonHeaders
storage local immutable apiHeaderName CNullTerminatedByteString "X-Api-Version"
call apiHeaderCall http.responseHeader
argument apiHeaderCall response HttpResponse response
argument apiHeaderCall name CNullTerminatedByteString apiHeaderName
argument apiHeaderCall value CNullTerminatedByteString runtime.apiVersionText
run apiHeaderCall
ignore value source apiHeaderCall type CSignedInt32
storage local immutable bodyLimitHeaderName CNullTerminatedByteString "X-Max-Body-Bytes"
storage local immutable bodyLimitHeaderValue CNullTerminatedByteString "65536"
call bodyLimitHeaderCall http.responseHeader
argument bodyLimitHeaderCall response HttpResponse response
argument bodyLimitHeaderCall name CNullTerminatedByteString bodyLimitHeaderName
argument bodyLimitHeaderCall value CNullTerminatedByteString bodyLimitHeaderValue
run bodyLimitHeaderCall
ignore value source bodyLimitHeaderCall type CSignedInt32
return void

